Stephen Meatheringham (sjm@merlin.anu.edu.au) wrote:
: I accidentally stepped on a polymorph trap and was luckily wearing a ring of
: poly. control.   I polymorphed into a Vampire Lord - was this good choice??
: I have a lovely -17 AC, but the 47 HP are a worry.   Can (or should I) poly.
: back to my old self with a -8 AC and 102 HP??

I think Vampire Lords are one of the best:
1) You don't burst out of your armor
2) You drain levels
3) You can weild/wear everything that a human can
4) You regenerate

I also like a Master Lich.  You at least have 1 and 3.  You also do cold
damage.

: 
: Any comments?

Find out the benefits of all the monsters.  Trappers can eat a shopkeeper
in one hit!  Unfortuanately once you become sated, you only do a few hit
points.

Nymphs can steal things.
Dragons can breath fire/lay eggs.
After a dragon egg hatches, you can eat the baby, or kill it and
  polymorph its corpse.
There are many creatures which lay eggs
Some monsters can summon others 

Just be aware which monsters have which weapon and armor restrictions.

